# Source: the host tests of the prototype tree at prototype@ec8305c618a8f4e84e0707fa56beac5673f4675e, src/arch/aarch64/paging/tests.rs, src/platform/mapping.rs, src/memory/extents.rs, src/memory/tests.rs, src/memory/tests/banks.rs and src/memory/tests/reservations.rs.
# Inputs and outputs are in the notation of docs/domains/memory/page-tables/contract.md, Legacy test vectors, with the forms of the vector notation of docs/domains/memory/page-tables/specification.md; each expected output is that of the contract's row.
# A case is one call of an entry that the test makes with the output that it asserts: sets= the sets of the test, memory= the boot memory map of a direct map, do= its earlier calls and writes, call= the call, ask= what the test asserts of the state after it; a page ownership table and the values of a test are named by the calls that make them.
